{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. Thanks for making time for this change-control huddle at 08:00. As you know, Welding Cell 5 is running on a controller firmware version that hits end of vendor support this month, and we have a tentative firmware retrofit scheduled for Friday before the next production run. Before I authorize the work, I need to hear from controls engineering, production planning, and quality on any relevant requirements or concerns. Let's start with controls engineering — what do we need to know about the firmware retrofit from your side?"}
```

